### 📝 Notes for Frontend Team

* Backend expects:

  * `dateOfBirth`: format `YYYY-MM-DD`
  * `availableTimings`: a nested dictionary object (not stringified)

    ```json
    {
      "monday": ["10-2", "3-4"],
      "tuesday": ["9-11"]
    }
    ```
  * `languages`: a list of strings (e.g., `["English", "Hindi"]`)
  * Files are not yet implemented (uploading disabled for now)

